#kodovani_dokumentu
Encoding:
#help_non_unicode
Only changes the codepage sign. Does not change the font.
#help_inter_znaku
Conversions between single characters and multiple characters sequences in UTF-8 or UTF-16.
Some subfunctions are also applied to text blocks and some apply only to the entire document.
If switching from non-Unicode to Unicode or vice-versa, it changes the font.

#help_tabkonv_znaku
Recode the characters using conversion tables. The number of characters remains the same.
Can be applied to the entire document or only to a specified block.
If switching from non-Unicode to Unicode or vice-versa, it changes the font.

